{"question_id": "S002", "request_id": "069be75a9a854513885f336340b57cfa", "trace_id": "ec2b8a4c69b04a83911b782f4dc5e949", "http_status": 200, "answer": "根据手册内容，SUMMIT 2196 系列泵的入口管路应按照以下要求进行选择和布置：\n\n1. 所有管路必须单独支撑，并与泵的入口法兰准确对正。\n2. 最好在与泵法兰直接相连的接头处放置一小段软短管或波纹式短管。\n3. 切勿用力将管路与泵法兰对正。\n4. 如果使用管路异径接头，应将其置于泵与止回阀之间（根据出口管路布置推断，入口侧若需异径，也应遵循类似原则，但手册未明确说明入口异径接头的具体布置）。\n\n以上信息来源于《安装、操作及维护手册》（文件：2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf，页码：10）。", "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 10, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c99ee01e2d93-000-c99ee01e2d93"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 17, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2"}], "refusal": false, "retrieved_chunk_ids": ["cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c99ee01e2d93-000-c99ee01e2d93", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-2a41f111f816-000-2a41f111f816", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-98af0d342570-000-98af0d342570", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5d8e22b0294d-000-5d8e22b0294d", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-114bea8f37bc-000-114bea8f37bc", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-UMP-23b1f25858d6-000-23b1f25858d6", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ac65104a0a87-000-ac65104a0a87", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5ce75c93c0a1-000-5ce75c93c0a1", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-1693c615d124-000-1693c615d124", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-bcf1ceba3dbf-000-bcf1ceba3dbf", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f14509fdd142-000-f14509fdd142", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05e5a8a76b70-000-05e5a8a76b70", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-6b59e1a95c3b-000-6b59e1a95c3b", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e39749fc478f-000-e39749fc478f", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-bc9a8faa74b1-000-bc9a8faa74b1", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--保证-dd1d1d77b0bf-000-dd1d1d77b0bf", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-902ad3be0171-000-902ad3be0171", "cchunk-p