{"question_id": "S003", "request_id": "9950498b59a84d99bc2306ca7652cfa3", "trace_id": "cf983c91d7234503a006e2e20ed5a992", "http_status": 200, "answer": "根据手册内容，SUMMIT 2196 系列泵出口管路中的止回阀、隔离阀和异径接头的布置要求如下：\n\n- 出口管路应包含隔离阀和止回阀。\n- 止回阀用于防止泵反向旋转，应置于泵和隔离阀之间。\n- 如果使用管路异径接头，应将其置于泵与止回阀之间。\n\n综上，从泵出口开始，管路元件的顺序应为：泵 → 异径接头（如有）→ 止回阀 → 隔离阀。", "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 10, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c99ee01e2d93-000-c99ee01e2d93"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 17, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3"}], "refusal": false, "retrieved_chunk_ids": ["cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c99ee01e2d93-000-c99ee01e2d93", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-98af0d342570-000-98af0d342570", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-38cc6dafdf6c-000-38cc6dafdf6c", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-1693c615d124-000-1693c615d124", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-2020c244c35a-000-2020c244c35a", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-114bea8f37bc-000-114bea8f37bc", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5d8e22b0294d-000-5d8e22b0294d", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-70af961007ec-000-70af961007ec", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c8188ff9d303-000-c8188ff9d303", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-4cd7129b566b-000-4cd7129b566b", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-4613074313de-000-4613074313de", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ac65104a0a87-000-ac65104a0a87", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-bcf1ceba3dbf-000-bcf1ceba3dbf", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-9bb5dcbbe01c-000-9bb5dcbbe01c", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-902ad3be0171-000-902ad3be0171", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-2ecc4dee4a81-000-2ecc4dee4a81", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-2328c2b8800f-000-2328c2b8800f", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-UMP-23b1f25858d6-000-23b1f25858d6"], "shadow_audit": null, "total_latency": 0.467, "i