{"question_id": "S004", "request_id": "0d62e282248d4e03803ba084332d6654", "trace_id": "9e00dddc854f4ba7a1a6a6740f27698a", "http_status": 200, "answer": "根据手册内容，SUMMIT 2196 系列泵在连接两个半联轴器之前，应检查并调整平行和角度对正，使误差保持在 **0.005 英寸内**。\n\n对于在高温下工作的泵，还需要在工作温度下进行对正检查。", "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 11, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-114bea8f37bc-000-114bea8f37bc"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 24, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f14509fdd142-000-f14509fdd142"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 30, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-9336ae989edd-000-9336ae989edd"}], "refusal": false, "retrieved_chunk_ids": ["cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-114bea8f37bc-000-114bea8f37bc", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-修计划-e6e1457363ac-000-e6e1457363ac", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-70af961007ec-000-70af961007ec", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-UMP-dba67c4eaac4-000-dba67c4eaac4", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c8188ff9d303-000-c8188ff9d303", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-ee9e71b6148a-000-ee9e71b6148a", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-4cd7129b566b-000-4cd7129b566b", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-f6f642d9c92b-000-f6f642d9c92b", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ac65104a0a87-000-ac65104a0a87", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f480c35cb40b-000-f480c35cb40b", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-9336ae989edd-000-9336ae989edd", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-17ce9c469745-000-17ce9c469745", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-99d80f6fd8a0-000-99d80f6fd8a0", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-07d5c9ba07e1-000-07d5c9ba07e1", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f14509fdd142-000-f14509fdd142", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-0cdb66a95926-000-0cdb66a95926", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-37b1df45912a-000-37b1df45912a", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-体说明-339be7457d7e-000-339be7457d7e", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-abc00ad64f98-000-abc00ad64f98"], "shadow_audit": null, "total_latency": 0.501, "input_tokens": 1396, "output_tokens": 67, "total_tokens": 1463, "cache_hit