{"question_id": "S009", "request_id": "4aafd40bcbc04da2984b83b13e6632fe", "trace_id": "31a3e445561b460688d6e20ccc39b946", "http_status": 200, "answer": "根据SUMMIT泵的安装、操作及维护手册：\n\n1. **适用温度**：  \n   对于泵送物质温度为 -60°F 至 350°F 的情况，可使用润滑脂润滑轴承。温度超过 350°F 时不建议使用润滑脂。\n\n2. **稠度要求**：  \n   应使用 NLGI 2 号稠度的润滑脂。\n\n3. **重新润滑周期**：  \n   每三个月对轴承进行一次重新润滑。\n\n此外，手册推荐使用的润滑脂包括雪铁戈（Chevron）Mystic EP2。重新润滑时需清洁接头，取下排放塞，注入润滑脂直至从排放孔流出，然后重新装上排放塞。", "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 16, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e39749fc478f-000-e39749fc478f"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 14, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-8a9134f69b7a-000-8a9134f69b7a"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 15, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-38cc6dafdf6c-000-38cc6dafdf6c"}], "refusal": false, "retrieved_chunk_ids": ["cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e39749fc478f-000-e39749fc478f", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-0f5b719ca344-001-4ab791aa4c5a", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-8a9134f69b7a-000-8a9134f69b7a", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-修计划-e6e1457363ac-000-e6e1457363ac", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-修计划-a2424277ba17-000-a2424277ba17", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5e8b5807c2d6-000-5e8b5807c2d6", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d3acb0d357fb-000-d3acb0d357fb", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-38cc6dafdf6c-000-38cc6dafdf6c", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-8388f4f6e715-000-8388f4f6e715", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--保证-dd1d1d77b0bf-000-dd1d1d77b0bf", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-982c7b1dac30-000-982c7b1dac30", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e112e31e2351-000-e112e31e2351", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-672e2a7155d2-000-672e2a7155d2", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-修计划-4208f74efa29-000-4208f74efa29", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-时存放-2c2d77b40d00-000-2c2d77b40d00", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-0f5b719ca344-000-ef8e31c4555e", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e0adf1305803-000-e0adf1305803", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c8188ff9d303-000-c8188ff9d303", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d913d9c15acb-000-d913d9c15acb", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ef0141aa033d-000-6b0a2891be0c"], "shadow_audit": null, "total_latency": 0.498, "input_tokens": 1451, "output_tokens": 159, "total_tokens": 1610, "cache_hit": true, "error": null, "stage": "golden_subset", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "configured_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "provider_reported_model": null, "provider_reported_model_available": false, "fallback_enabled": false, "fallback_detected": false, "actual_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28"}
{"question_id": "S011", "request_id": "604b396d390a4345ae95cc8969db541b", "trace_id": "383ad6bed7454f59a2b5a3c7a2744c18", "http_status": 200, "answer": "根据 SUMMIT PUMP 2196 / 2196-LF / 2196-R / 2796 型安装、操作及维护手册，离心泵的标准启动步骤如下：\n\n1. 用手旋转泵，确保旋转部件能够自由转动。  \n2. 确保入口阀打开。  \n3. 将出口阀半关闭。  \n4. 解除对泵驱动器电源的锁定。  \n5. 电机一旦达到工作速度，就慢慢打开出口阀。  \n6. 检查填料函的滴漏情况，必要时进行调整，达到每分钟滴漏 40–65 滴的速度。\n\n此外，在启动前还需注意：\n- 启动泵之前，应检查叶轮间隙（运输期间设置可能发生变化）。\n- 启动离心泵之前，必须在入口管路和泵体中充入液体以完成灌注。灌注时应打开入口隔离阀和填料密封液阀。\n\n来源：2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf，第17页", "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 17, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 49, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-70af961007ec-000-70af961007ec"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 53, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c8188ff9d303-000-c8188ff9d303"}], "refusal": false, "retrieved_chunk_ids": ["cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f480c35cb40b-000-f480c35cb40b", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-70af961007ec-000-70af961007ec", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-3fb7c4549485-000-3fb7c4549485", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c8188ff9d303-000-c8188ff9d303", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-a02fa314dd25-000-a02fa314dd25", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-1693c615d124-000-1693c615d124", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--目录-c493e2a39742-000-c493e2a39742", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-0cdb66a95926-000-0cdb66a95926", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5d8e22b0294d-000-5d8e22b0294d", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f829dd9751db-000-f829dd9751db", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--保证-dd1d1d77b0bf-000-dd1d1d77b0bf", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-16f10cf37f32-000-16f10cf37f32", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-6b59e1a95c3b-000-6b59e1a95c3b", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-27aa8c4f9db8-000-27aa8c4f9db8", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e39749fc478f-000-e39749fc478f", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-0d5ac