{"question_id": "S012", "request_id": "976c988a93fb499580bdbf2f29683142", "trace_id": "9115dd9082ae4fb2944cc286a39d084a", "http_status": 200, "answer": "根据手册内容，SUMMIT 2196 系列泵的停机步骤如下：\n\n1. 逐渐关上出口阀并关闭电机电源。  \n2. 切断泵驱动器的电源。\n\n（来源：安装、操作及维护手册，文件 2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf，第 18 页）", "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 16, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e39749fc478f-000-e39749fc478f"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 11, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-114bea8f37bc-000-114bea8f37bc"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 18, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-1693c615d124-000-1693c615d124"}], "refusal": false, "retrieved_chunk_ids": ["cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-1693c615d124-000-1693c615d124", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-卸泵组-231afb91e1bf-000-231afb91e1bf", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-4dd0fef6dc96-000-4dd0fef6dc96", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-2328c2b8800f-000-2328c2b8800f", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5378c1b369fe-000-5378c1b369fe", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c8188ff9d303-000-c8188ff9d303", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-6bbb16843e56-000-6bbb16843e56", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5d8e22b0294d-000-5d8e22b0294d", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f09dece39f2f-000-f09dece39f2f", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-70af961007ec-000-70af961007ec", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ae87a0057a63-000-ae87a0057a63", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e39749fc478f-000-e39749fc478f", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-1d4c1c439ff8-000-1d4c1c439ff8", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-6b59e1a95c3b-000-6b59e1a95c3b", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-c6a06fd201e8-000-c6a06fd201e8", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-114bea8f37bc-000-114bea8f37bc", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-37b1df45912a-000-37b1df45912a", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-bc9a8faa74b1-000-bc9a8faa74b1"], "shadow_audit": null, "total_latency": 0.459, "input_tokens": 1275, "output_tokens": 78, "tota