{"question_id": "S014", "request_id": "a1644f404f8d4a4c82570a993b5dea4b", "trace_id": "c3479ff24ff64b73a82d0de4ad01ca71", "http_status": 200, "answer": "根据手册内容，使用塞尺法设置 2196-R 型泵叶轮间隙时，最终塞尺厚度的确定方法如下：\n\n使用塞尺测量轴承架 (228) 与轴承座 (134) 之间的间隙，将测量值降低 0.060”，由此确定轴承架 (228) 与轴承座 (134) 之间的最终塞尺厚度。\n\n依据来源：[[INDUSTRIAL_RAG_SOURCE file=2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf page=20]]", "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 20, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-902ad3be0171-000-902ad3be0171"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 19, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ef0141aa033d-001-eaf26ba98522"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 5, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-27aa8c4f9db8-000-27aa8c4f9db8"}], "refusal": false, "retrieved_chunk_ids": ["cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ef0141aa033d-001-eaf26ba98522", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-902ad3be0171-000-902ad3be0171", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-2ecc4dee4a81-000-2ecc4dee4a81", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-27aa8c4f9db8-000-27aa8c4f9db8", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-9776f1f8dc59-000-9776f1f8dc59", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-8e3faa2777df-000-8e3faa2777df", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ef0141aa033d-000-6b0a2891be0c", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ac65104a0a87-000-ac65104a0a87", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e9ebcc9a1e56-000-e9ebcc9a1e56", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-114bea8f37bc-000-114bea8f37bc", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-779c0923acb6-000-779c0923acb6", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-9619443a1a8a-000-9619443a1a8a", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-0f5b719ca344-000-ef8e31c4555e", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-16f10cf37f32-000-16f10cf37f32", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-bc9a8faa74b1-000-bc9a8faa74b1", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f14509fdd142-000-f14509fdd142", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-b2b8fd5c7f09-000-b2b8fd5c7f09", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ca38e173969e-000-ca38e173969e", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3"], "shadow_audit": 