{"question_id": "S015", "request_id": "df721a5e2ae44ad1b56444b052940b31", "trace_id": "9c19ff829de148b5a9ce1c05f4b91aa6", "http_status": 200, "answer": "根据SUMMIT泵手册，泵不输送液体的常见原因及对应处理方法如下：\n\n- **泵没有灌注**  \n  处理方法：重新灌注泵。\n\n- **旋转方向不正确**  \n  处理方法：调换电机接线。\n\n- **叶轮卡塞**  \n  处理方法：反向冲洗泵。\n\n- **入口管路堵塞**  \n  处理方法：去除异物。\n\n以上内容来源于《安装、操作及维护手册》表7（文件：2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf，页码23）。", "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 11, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-114bea8f37bc-000-114bea8f37bc"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 24, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f14509fdd142-000-f14509fdd142"}], "refusal": false, "retrieved_chunk_ids": ["cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-a02fa314dd25-000-a02fa314dd25", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f14509fdd142-000-f14509fdd142", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c667c6669da3-000-c667c6669da3", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--保证-dd1d1d77b0bf-000-dd1d1d77b0bf", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-30de72d7ddcc-000-30de72d7ddcc", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5d8e22b0294d-000-5d8e22b0294d", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-757db2bb9446-000-757db2bb9446", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-1693c615d124-000-1693c615d124", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ca38e173969e-000-ca38e173969e", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e39749fc478f-000-e39749fc478f", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c8c9aad986b9-000-c8c9aad986b9", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c8188ff9d303-000-c8188ff9d303", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-38cc6dafdf6c-000-38cc6dafdf6c", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-70af961007ec-000-70af961007ec", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-9619443a1a8a-000-9619443a1a8a", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5ce75c93c0a1-000-5ce75c93c0a1", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e8103950065a-000-e8103950065a", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-114bea8f37bc-000-114bea8f37bc", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f480c35cb40b-000-f480c35cb40b"], "shadow_audit": null, "total_latency": 0.599, "input_tokens": 1343, "output_tokens": 129, "total_tokens": 1472, "cache_hit": true, "error": null, "stage": "golden_subset", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "configured_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "provider_reported_model": null, "provider_reported_model_available": false, "fallback_enabled": false, "fallback_detected": false, "actual_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28"}
{"question_id": "S016", "request_id": "e3ffac6d4d5648dab333b0c59f1b1fc6", "trace_id": "ce4298eee8134c95833fd23ed0314144", "http_status": 200, "answer": "根据SUMMIT泵手册，轴承高温运行通常由以下原因造成及相应的处理方法如下：\n\n1. **没有对正**  \n   - 处理方法：重新对正驱动联轴器。\n\n2. **润滑油位低或润滑油不足**  \n   - 处理方法：检查油位和/或润滑脂。\n\n3. **液体比规定的重量重**  \n   - 处理方法：检查液体的比重。\n\n此外，手册还指出滚珠轴承对过度润滑和润滑不足均十分敏感，这两种情况都会损害轴承性能并可能导致过热。建议使用温度计监控轴承温度，并参考表2中轴承温度与泵送液体温度之间的关系作为性能指标。\n\n（信息来源：安装、操作及维护手册，文件2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf，页码14、24）", "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 24, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f14509fdd142-000-f14509fdd142"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 14, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-8a9134f69b7a-000-8a9134f69b7a"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 16, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e39749fc478f-000-e39749fc478f"}], "refusal": false, "retrieved_chunk_ids": ["cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-8a9134f69b7a-000-8a9134f69b7a", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-1cc3c61d9b66-000-1cc3c61d9b66", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-8ac24fa36ba6-000-8ac24fa36ba6", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-UMP-23b1f25858d6-000-23b1f25858d6", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e39749fc478f-000-e39749fc478f", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-修计划-e6e1457363ac-000-e6e1457363ac", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e112e31e2351-000-e112e31e2351", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-966f32e2cd65-000-966f32e2cd65", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-a667c5b9cb55-000-a667c5b9cb55", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-30de72d7ddcc-000-30de72d7ddcc", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-0f5b719ca344-000-ef8e31c4555e", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-0f44c075b8e8-000-0f44c075b8e8", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f14509fdd142-000-f14509fdd142", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c99ee01e2d93-000-c99ee01e2d93", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-9bb5dcbbe01c-000-9bb5dcbbe01c", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d583b5c98bcc-000-d583b5c98bcc", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-bcf1ceba3dbf-000-bcf1ceba3dbf", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-38cc6dafdf6c-000-38cc6dafdf6c", "cchunk-py