{"question_id": "S017", "request_id": "fca71a7998304fce9d4e1180500e2301", "trace_id": "7affd716a14e494a8d85cea27d57bc77", "http_status": 200, "answer": "根据 SUMMIT PUMP 安装、操作及维护手册，在尝试对泵进行维修之前必须完成以下安全步骤：\n\n1. 执行停机程序。  \n2. 切断电源。  \n3. 使泵冷却。  \n4. 关闭入口阀和出口阀。  \n5. 排空泵。\n\n（来源：文件 2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf，第 23 页）", "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 17, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 7, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5d8e22b0294d-000-5d8e22b0294d"}], "refusal": false, "retrieved_chunk_ids": ["cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-70af961007ec-000-70af961007ec", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-38cc6dafdf6c-000-38cc6dafdf6c", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c8188ff9d303-000-c8188ff9d303", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-779c0923acb6-000-779c0923acb6", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c528bd478df0-000-c528bd478df0", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--保证-dd1d1d77b0bf-000-dd1d1d77b0bf", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f829dd9751db-000-f829dd9751db", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-060a8c918f93-000-060a8c918f93", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-1693c615d124-000-1693c615d124", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-16f10cf37f32-000-16f10cf37f32", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5d8e22b0294d-000-5d8e22b0294d", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-0d5acaa63149-000-0d5acaa63149", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-2328c2b8800f-000-2328c2b8800f", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e8103950065a-000-e8103950065a", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e39749fc478f-000-e39749fc478f", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-757db2bb9446-000-757db2bb9446", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5ce75c93c0a1-000-5ce75c93c0a1", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ca38e173969e-000-ca38e173969e"], "shadow_audit": null, "total_latency": 0.557, "input_tokens":