{"question_id": "D003", "request_id": "814d42a4dd114f7ea09c0aa69003b978", "trace_id": "3c610cb8ffbd47be9898f6bfcfeabdc8", "http_status": 200, "answer": "根据DESMI手册内容：\n\n- **危险**：表示具有高风险的危险，不避免会导致死亡或重伤事故。\n- **警告**：表示中等风险的危险，不避免可能导致死亡或重伤事故。\n- **小心**：表示低风险的危险，不避免可能导致产品或系统损坏事故。", "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "t1739cn.pdf", "page": 7, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-1cfb2c984ef7-000-1cfb2c984ef7"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "t1739cn.pdf", "page": 33, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-98af0d342570-000-98af0d342570"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "t1739cn.pdf", "page": 3, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--目录-ad404fcfe9d1-000-ad404fcfe9d1"}], "refusal": false, "retrieved_chunk_ids": ["cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-1cfb2c984ef7-000-1cfb2c984ef7", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-c29eb53cc8f4-000-c29eb53cc8f4", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--目录-ad404fcfe9d1-000-ad404fcfe9d1", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-购备件-048a8c99e379-000-048a8c99e379", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-6a66fa385311-000-6a66fa385311", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-7317d1e142f7-000-7317d1e142f7", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-81de515827f2-000-81de515827f2", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-卸泵组-acca142a093d-000-acca142a093d", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-21ccbc8db89c-000-21ccbc8db89c", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-afb63a620bdc-000-afb63a620bdc", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-体说明-56bb9fd3b838-000-56bb9fd3b838", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-ba0013a974f4-000-ba0013a974f4", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-98af0d342570-000-98af0d342570", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-时存放-74f4fe18b887-000-74f4fe18b887", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-ee9e71b6148a-000-ee9e71b6148a", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-06c604348869-000-06c604348869", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-abc00ad64f98-000-abc00ad64f98", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-卸泵组-00210867202f-000-a6660ce7417e", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-d63330d6a102-000-d63330d6a102", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-b61a0dc4a8a2-000-b61a0dc4a8a2"], "shadow_audit": null, "total_latency": 0.464, "input_tokens": 1660, "output_tokens": 67, "total_tokens": 1727, "cache_hit": true, "error": null, "stage