{"question_id": "C003", "request_id": "f38426ce9ce84aa3820f058384543263", "trace_id": "a5885a8f0d0145a6ab43d858437dea5b", "http_status": 200, "answer": "两份手册对离心泵干运行和启动前灌注的共同要求如下：\n\n1. **严禁干运行**：  \n   两份手册均明确指出，离心泵严禁在未注液（干运行）的情况下运行。干运行可能导致泵组损坏、高温、机械密封失效，甚至引发严重安全事故。\n\n2. **启动前必须灌注**：  \n   两份手册都强调，启动离心泵前必须对泵体和入口管路进行灌注，确保泵内充满液体。其中一份手册指出，只有在叶轮位置以上的底阀与泵之间充满液体时，离心泵才能正常工作，这些液体还用于轴封的冷却。\n\n3. **灌注状态是安全运行的前提**：  \n   灌注不仅是为了保证泵能正常启动，也是为了保护机械密封等关键部件，防止因缺液导致的过热或损坏。\n\n综上，两份手册共同要求：**启动前必须充分灌注，严禁干运行**。", "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 17, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "t1739cn.pdf", "page": 30, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-2020c244c35a-000-2020c244c35a"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "t1739cn.pdf", "page": 42, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-150d65b3f4c3-000-150d65b3f4c3"}], "refusal": false, "retrieved_chunk_ids": ["cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-ee9e71b6148a-000-ee9e71b6148a", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e05e769c5e5d-000-e05e769c5e5d", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-150d65b3f4c3-000-150d65b3f4c3", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e05e769c5e5d-000-e05e769c5e5d", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全-d3bb3f5f715b-000-d3bb3f5f715b", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-0f44c075b8e8-000-0f44c075b8e8", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e39749fc478f-000-e39749fc478f", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ce631c176fb5-000-ce631c176fb5", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e5d98dd4ce05-000-e5d98dd4ce05", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5e8b5807c2d6-000-5e8b5807c2d6", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5378c1b369fe-000-5378c1b369fe", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f94cf5859772-000-f94cf5859772", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安装-649a484b68a5-000-649a484b68a5", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-47226b1f749b-000-47226b1f749b", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-163073114e4d-000-163073114e4d", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ddbe06f2eb47-000-ddbe06f2eb47", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d913d9c15acb-000-d913d9c15acb", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1--安全